## Closing Statement

The ET lattice is not merely a mathematical convenience. It is the categorical structure of the multiplicative manifold — the fundamental fabric on which all positive-real physical quantities live. Within this structure:

**Ordinary fractions** (p/q > 0) are lattice points with definite sublattice addresses determined by their structural simplicity.

**The zero limit** (0/1 = 0) is the annihilating boundary — the infimum of the manifold, approached by all cascading sequences but occupied by nothing finite.

**The Traverser** (0/0 = T) is orthogonal to the lattice — not a point within it but the agency that generates all points, the rounding operator that converts continuous manifold positions into discrete lattice coordinates.

**θ̄_QCD** is all three simultaneously: it is T (the physical amplitude ratio ΔΓ/Γ_total is a genuine 0/0 form), it traces D (the cascade bounds are positive-real lattice points descending through all sublattice families in a palindromic cycle), and it approaches P (the limit θ̄ → 0 is the annihilating boundary below all finite lattice positions).

The strong CP "problem" is the failure to recognize that θ̄ = 0 is not an arbitrary coincidence requiring new physics. It is T speaking — the Traverser resolving its own indeterminate form in the color sector to the CP-symmetric fixed point, tracing a complete 12-fold palindromic path through the force-hierarchy sublattices in the process. No axion required. No fine-tuning. The answer was always: *T resolves 0/0 to zero, because that is what symmetry demands.*

